1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,346
It's official: the second-year visa rules are changing.

2
00:00:03,346 --> 00:00:06,801
Doing your 88 days? Here's what Home Affairs announced.

3
00:00:06,901 --> 00:00:09,897
One. From 1 March 2027,

4
00:00:09,897 --> 00:00:12,791
a second visa needs 120 days

5
00:00:12,791 --> 00:00:15,046
of specified work, not 88.

6
00:00:15,046 --> 00:00:17,102
Work you've already done still counts.

7
00:00:17,202 --> 00:00:20,882
Two. From March, you'll also need an invitation to apply.

8
00:00:20,882 --> 00:00:23,718
Registrations open on 1 December,

9
00:00:23,718 --> 00:00:26,571
and you can register before you finish your days.

10
00:00:26,671 --> 00:00:28,755
Three. Finish your 88 days

11
00:00:28,755 --> 00:00:31,976
and lodge your application by 28 February?

12
00:00:31,976 --> 00:00:34,104
You can still use the current process.

13
00:00:34,104 --> 00:00:36,392
The third visa stays at six months.

14
00:00:36,492 --> 00:00:38,551
Save this so you don't miss the dates.

